<title>UK: EIB sets $200 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets $200 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IMI Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    25.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.451   PAY DATE    25.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.776    SPREAD	+3.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT JULY 2002 U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
